    "reviews": "\u201c<i>With its massive amount of content and the tiny tiny price \u2013 barely 5$ US or your regional equivalent \u2013 Assassination Station fares amazing well both as a casual experience and as an instant classic.</i>\u201d<br>Indie Toaster<br><br>\u201c<i>Players beware \u2014 Assassination Station is a fast, unforgiving game. Though you may die many-a-time, you will have a great time doing it.</i>\u201d<br>7.3 \u2013 Indie Ranger<br>",
